Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Beach Head 2000 (Global VR): the cabinet's registry. The frontend's ActiveX control
; (C:\Orion\ShellControl.ocx, its regsvr32 registration, safe for scripting and initializing as
; the cabinet's Internet Explorer settings let it run) and the shell's settings (the dump's
; BH2000_Shell/gvrshell_p.reg and shell/GVRShell_BH.reg). Imported at each launch: the payload
; then restores what the shell changed (operator settings, audits, high scores, coins), saved in
; the dump's BH2000_Shell/gvrshell-saved.reg.

